            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a loaded firearm.</p><hr /><p>You launch yourself across the battlefield. Stride and use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Black Powder Boost]. Make a melee Strike with an attached weapon or the required weapon's combination melee form, at any point during the Black Powder Boost.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Bullet Dancer Burn], apply the additional fire damage to the granted Strike.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
